Interactability_Text_Line_0 Dahmer's Log - September 16th 2008
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 After our tests from last week- Anthe refuses to let us go anywhere near her. Just today, she ended up slaughtering Luke, Olivia, Thomas, and James. I warned him. I warned him over and over again but he refused to listen to me. He is so focused on getting results- and he’s the sole reason she became afraid of all of us. If he keeps this up, I can only see two outcomes here. Either she cracks and dies under the pressure, or she cracks and the next breach will be the end of us all.